    displayName: The Ark-Bearers' Charge
    flavorText: David re-establishes that only Levites may carry the Ark by its staves,
      correcting the fatal error that cost Uzza his life.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Corrects the fatal error of moving the Ark by ox-cart, which led directly
      to Uzza's death, by re-establishing per the Law of Moses that only Levites
      may carry the Ark on their own shoulders by its staves, never by cart.
