  - id: the_twenty_year_reckoning
    displayName: The Twenty-Year Reckoning
    flavorText: David lowers the Levites' age of service to twenty and reassigns
      their duties now that the Ark no longer needs to be carried.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Lowers the age of eligible Levitical service from thirty to twenty and
      reassigns Levites from Ark-portage duty to assisting the priests, overseeing
      courts and treasuries, keeping the gates, and leading praise, now that the
      Ark rests permanently in Jerusalem.
    deliveredByManagerId: david
